{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"ja","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-20008","referenceCommit":"312b4597691e0a29cf9828a15b592757dba86949","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-20008-item-ItemConfigEquipment-20008-0","text":"豊穣の運命専用の光円錐、光円錐のスキルはこの運命にのみ有効。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-20008-item-ItemConfigEquipment-20008-1","text":"凝縮された時間から得られる希薄な力。一瞬にも満たない刹那が、壮絶な運命を織りなす。\n\n「喉が渇く時は、全てが甘くなる」","speaker":""}]}
